  "name": "Stratholme: an early courtyard acolyte kill leaves the ziggurats completable",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #10739: a ziggurat stayed uncompletable. The lone Thuzadin Acolyte in the courtyard (guid 53267) tells",
    "the closest Ash'ari Crystal, Baroness Anastari's, to finish her ziggurat when it dies. Killed before the",
    "Baroness, it destroyed her crystal while the ziggurat state was still 0, so her ziggurat never reached 2 and",
    "the Slaughter Square (175373) and Gauntlet (175374) gates stayed shut. Each crystal now reacts only after its",
    "boss died. The hero kills the courtyard acolyte first, then every boss and acolyte, and both gates open."
  ],
